<title>USA: Napocor issues $360 million gtd bonds in two parts.</title>
<headline>Napocor issues $360 million gtd bonds in two parts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-part debt</p>
<p>issue from Philippines' National Power Corp (Napocor) was</p>
<p>priced Tuesday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER NATIONAL POWER CORP (NAPOCOR)</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.875 PCT  MATURITY 12/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE GTD BONDS     ISS PRICE 99.945  FIRST PAY DATE 6/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 7.883 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD 167 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>AMT $160 MLN	 COUPON 8.40 PCT   MATURITY 12/15/16</p>
<p>TYPE GTD BONDS     ISS PRICE 99.568  FIRST PAY DATE 6/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 8.445 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD 190 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
